    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is action shooter in greats pixel with old black and white colors, anyway in some parts you can see a color, you go across levels and escape from a secret crime organization building of 20 floors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game time is an hour and a half, two hours, but the enemy non have same movement and the difficult selection of energy packs with the score of kills that have addiction in end level , it can give replay reasons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some strange rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the view is from top like some classics</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >shoot various enemies</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >your movements are only horizontal and vertical with lateral movement lock, but enemy are more free</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learn to see bullets tracks of enemies with some practice</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore 20 levels</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >some limited health packs from levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >setting of levels of cure of energy pack from start menu, from 1, hard, to 5 , easy, because cure fill 5 energy points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the game save to the end of levels, all with settings of cure of energy pack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In interface left, you can see your life points, ,in the interface right, you can see a indicator of exit teleporter, be carefull, the indicator not calculate walls, you can lost in a closed way, number of medipacks and enemies in level are indicated, study your strategy or you give power to your anxiety...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the keys for game is</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keyboard\u00a0 \u00a0 gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >arrows\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 left pad\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >x\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0right trigger shoot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >z\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0left trigger\u00a0 \u00a0always pressed and move for lateral movement lock</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >p\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 select\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0game pause</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >esc\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0start\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0exit level without save</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, after I have say this... you can save the situation?\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816960/extras/ebf277e2a4f5eb36c689eb0abfec4e62.avif?t=1754292177\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816960/extras/3ca18df65284ddf2bccfe4c2c7083354.avif?t=1754292177\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816960/extras/0a558af0dec94dc563017e512a036853.avif?t=1754292177\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
